    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/d75328aa92aede56327d2f0ebf914e2b.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/53d4ae8e0b9eeb874bf0363aefd4dbfa.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span>Nephilim Resurrection is a thrilling retro-style first-person shooter that immerses players in an ancient Mesopotamian steampunk world. Set against the backdrop of an alternate ancient civilization, the game seamlessly blends historical aesthetics with futuristic steam-powered technology. As a lone survivor, you\u2019ll navigate a perilous ancient world, safeguarding your most precious cargo; and the weight of this unspoken burden rests upon your shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frenetic Boomer Shooter Action: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic boomer shooter game play, where adrenaline-fueled combat meets cerebral puzzles and strategic encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thundering Heavy Metal Soundtrack: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pulse-pounding retro-meets-progressive-heavy metal-inspired soundtrack, underpins your harrowing journey. Find us on Spotify!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Destiny:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Act swiftly to determine the fate the protagonist and their prize in a world teetering on the edge of transformation and ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/d75328aa92aede56327d2f0ebf914e2b.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/c57c5278e6104e9ebbda91c7ced22948.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Perspective:</strong> Experience the action from a first-person viewpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Focus:</strong> Tailored for solo play, the game emphasizes PvE encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulously Designed Levels:</strong> Navigate through intricately crafted environments, each filled with challenges and combat sequences against waves of enemies and challenging bosses with puzzle platforming elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Choose from many unlockable, powerful weapons; each offering a distinct playstyle. Adapt your strategy to overcome adversaries. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Special Abilities:</strong> Breathe underwater, manipulate time, and execute gravity-defying double jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by an independent company</strong> Arrogant Pixel. 100% self-published and self-funded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music and Sound Design</strong> is a big focus in our games, and we've got another full soundtrack composed by AssadB and our in-house metal band &quot;NEPHILLIM RESURRECTION&quot; </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/d75328aa92aede56327d2f0ebf914e2b.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/53d4ae8e0b9eeb874bf0363aefd4dbfa.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span>Nephilim Resurrection is a thrilling retro-style first-person shooter that immerses players in an ancient Mesopotamian steampunk world. Set against the backdrop of an alternate ancient civilization, the game seamlessly blends historical aesthetics with futuristic steam-powered technology. As a lone survivor, you\u2019ll navigate a perilous ancient world, safeguarding your most precious cargo; and the weight of this unspoken burden rests upon your shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frenetic Boomer Shooter Action: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic boomer shooter game play, where adrenaline-fueled combat meets cerebral puzzles and strategic encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thundering Heavy Metal Soundtrack: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pulse-pounding retro-meets-progressive-heavy metal-inspired soundtrack, underpins your harrowing journey. Find us on Spotify!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Destiny:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Act swiftly to determine the fate the protagonist and their prize in a world teetering on the edge of transformation and ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/d75328aa92aede56327d2f0ebf914e2b.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847830/extras/c57c5278e6104e9ebbda91c7ced22948.avif?t=1745161697\" width=612 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Perspective:</strong> Experience the action from a first-person viewpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Focus:</strong> Tailored for solo play, the game emphasizes PvE encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulously Designed Levels:</strong> Navigate through intricately crafted environments, each filled with challenges and combat sequences against waves of enemies and challenging bosses with puzzle platforming elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Choose from many unlockable, powerful weapons; each offering a distinct playstyle. Adapt your strategy to overcome adversaries. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Special Abilities:</strong> Breathe underwater, manipulate time, and execute gravity-defying double jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by an independent company</strong> Arrogant Pixel. 100% self-published and self-funded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music and Sound Design</strong> is a big focus in our games, and we've got another full soundtrack composed by AssadB and our in-house metal band &quot;NEPHILLIM RESURRECTION&quot; </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a furious journey, protecting precious cargo in a perilous world. Boomer shooter mechanics blend with puzzles and strategic encounters. Engage in PvE action, solve puzzles, and battle foes to a heavy metal soundtrack, immersing you in the adrenaline-fueled atmosphere.",
