        "notes": "In \"Nephilim Resurrection,\" players can expect mature content typical of a boomer shooter genre, including depictions of violence as the player engages in combat against enemies. However, there are no depictions of sexual acts or explicit sexual content in the game. The storyline primarily revolves around themes of heroism, sacrifice, and redemption, without elements such as sexual assault, drug and alcohol abuse, or self-harm.\r\n\r\nWhile the game features intense combat and action-packed gameplay, it is free from any explicit or graphic content that may be sensitive or triggering to certain players. As a boomer shooter, the primary focus is on defeating enemies and overcoming challenges within the game world. We are committed to providing an engaging and immersive experience while respecting the boundaries and sensitivities of our players."
